<div class="body-col reveal">
<span class="label section-label"><span class="num">i.</span><span class="icon-inline"><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-practice"></use></svg>Practice</span></span>
<h2>A senior insurer-side practice across placement, broker relations, and underwriting enablement.</h2>
<div style="margin-top: 36px;">
<p>
              Current role at <strong>Orient Insurance PJSC</strong> as Assistant Vice President,
              Broker Relations. Responsible for an <span class="crm">AED 200M</span> broker
              portfolio across <span class="crm"><strong>40+ brokers</strong></span> in the UAE market, with active
              involvement in Global fronting programs across general and specialty lines.
            </p>
<p>
              Prior corporate-side experience at <strong>GMG</strong>, managing group insurance portfolios — general, medical, and life —
              across MENA and South East Asia. The role covered direct renewal negotiation
              with brokers and insurers across multiple jurisdictions, and gave a working
              view of placement from the buyer's seat.
            </p>
<p>
              Continuing technical development with a current focus on specialty and
              financial lines. Certified in <strong>Cyber Liability</strong> and
              <strong>Professional Liability</strong> through PLUS USA, and working
              through the ARM, CPCU, and RPLU designations from The Institutes and PLUS,
              alongside the Certificate Programme in Generative AI for Professionals from
              Indian Institute of Technology Patna (IIT Patna).
            </p>
<p>
              Alongside core placement work, I study and integrate practical applications of
              <strong>generative AI</strong> within insurance operations, with a focus on improving
              underwriting efficiency, decision support, portfolio insight, and the quality of
              broker and client servicing.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="practice-highlights">
<div class="practice-highlight">
<span class="label"><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-insurance"></use></svg>Insurance</span>
<strong>General, specialty, and financial lines placement.</strong>
</div>
<div class="practice-highlight">
